                            <comment id="16526622" author="ezhuravl" created="Thu, 28 Jun 2018 18:05:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Here is the new TC run for this suite and it looks good: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_Basic1&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F4249%2Fhead&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_Basic1&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F4249%2Fhead&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
